{"id":"b7440ca29cd784bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-rank-map.md","title":"ZFC Rank Map","display":"df-zfc-rank-map — ZFC Rank Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rank-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rank-map"],"display":"df-zfc-rank-map — ZFC Rank Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rank-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rank-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rank-map — ZFC Rank Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\subseteq V\\times\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\">\\(r\\subseteq V\\times\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\\)</span> (metalinguistic definable-class graph parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RankMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RankMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate on definable class graphs defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}map} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{RankMap}_S(r)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\forall z\\in r\\;\\exists x,\\alpha\\in V\\;(z=\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\exists!\\alpha\\in V\\;\n(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in r\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha))\n\\land\\forall x,\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in r\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\alpha=\\bigcup\\{\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\}:\n\\exists y\\in x\\;(\\langle y,\\beta\\rangle\\in r)\\}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}map} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{RankMap}_S(r)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\forall z\\in r\\;\\exists x,\\alpha\\in V\\;(z=\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\exists!\\alpha\\in V\\;\n(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in r\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha))\n\\land\\forall x,\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in r\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\alpha=\\bigcup\\{\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\}:\n\\exists y\\in x\\;(\\langle y,\\beta\\rangle\\in r)\\}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The global rank is represented by a definable class graph, not by a nonexistent set function with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The last clause is the well-founded recursion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}(x)=\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)+1:y\\in x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}(x)=\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)+1:y\\in x\\}\\)</span> written with bounded set comprehension.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"r\\subseteq V\\times\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RankMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}map} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{RankMap}_S(r)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\forall z\\in r\\;\\exists x,\\alpha\\in V\\;(z=\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\exists!\\alpha\\in V\\;\n(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in r\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha))\n\\land\\forall x,\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle\\in r\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\alpha=\\bigcup\\{\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\}:\n\\exists y\\in x\\;(\\langle y,\\beta\\rangle\\in r)\\}\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}(x)=\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)+1:y\\in x\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1355,"backlinks":[{"id":"75dcbb9ddb4d707f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{rank}(x)$ (rank map, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-rank-map.md]])"},{"id":"22f0af31d974b262","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"exce